## Non-interference

This is one of four special criteria which all content on a page needs to meet, even if it is normally out of scope of an audit (such as adverts or other third party content). These are referred to as "non-interference" criteria because content must not interfere with the rest of the page. The official standard has [more detail about non-interference](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/#cc5).